This is an early test project. Your memories are kept separate from other users', but they aren't encrypted on the server, so the person running this bot could read them. Messages also pass through Telegram and Anthropic. Please don't send passwords, bank details or medical records.

Recall isn't a mental health service or for emergencies. If you're struggling, please reach out to someone you trust or a local crisis line.

/nudge checks for anything you've left unfinished
/undo reverses the last save
/forget <words> erases one entry
/export downloads everything
/delete_all erases everything
/timezone <Area/City> sets your time zone
/quiet 22:00 08:00 or /quiet off sets quiet hours
/pause and /resume control proactive messages
/unmute <kind> turns a reminder type back on
